Selected Problem Type: Image Classification
This dataset represents an image classification problem.

Why?
The dataset contains images grouped into predefined categories/classes. Each image belongs to exactly one class label.
The goal of the model is to:
Read the input image
Learn visual patterns from the image
Predict the correct class label

Unlike object detection or segmentation, the task does not require:
Detecting object locations
Drawing bounding boxes
Pixel-level segmentation
Therefore, image classification is the most suitable computer vision problem type.
